- agent_formats: numbered reads (cat -n, N|, N:) route as code, code is no
  longer read as CSV/TSV/YAML; unified-diff, grep/rg and pytest/jest/go/cargo
  adapters; every adapter cut carries the caller's gap_marker. A query that
  matches nothing fails open instead of cutting.
- folding: fold_lossless (CR redraws, ANSI, trailing whitespace, identical
  runs, JSON minify with parse round-trip), idempotent and round-trip safe.
- logs: Drain3-style template masking, [last] exemplar; json_brief for JSON
  that matches nothing.
- Release: version 1.4.0, CHANGELOG, RESEARCH takeaways, benchmarks re-run
  (battery 15/15, sweep clean, savings unchanged vs 1.3.0).

